message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "nf-illumina2lineage: A Nextflow pipeline for SARS-CoV-2 genome assembly and lineage analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mishra"
    given-names: "Abhinav"
    orcid: "0009-0005-3179-7408"
    affiliation: "Freie Universität Berlin"
