  - family-names: "Mishra"
    given-names: "Abhinav"
    email: "mishraabhinav36@gmail.com"
license-url: "https://opensource.org/license/bsd-3-clause"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bibymaths/nf-illumina2lineage"
url: "https://github.com/bibymaths/nf-illumina2lineage"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible and modular Nextflow pipeline for SARS-CoV-2 genome assembly and
  lineage analysis from Illumina paired-end sequencing data. The pipeline automates
  read quality control, reference-based mapping, primer clipping, variant calling,
  consensus generation, lineage assignment, and phylogenetic analysis.
  Developed as part of the SARS-2 Bioinformatics & Data Science course.
